<title>SWITZERLAND: Swissair August load factor up 1.2 pct.</title>
<headline>Swissair August load factor up 1.2 pct.</headline>
<dateline>ZURICH 1996-09-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swissair Schweizerische Luftverkehr AG said its load factor rose in August by 1.2 percent to 70.8 percent from 69.9 percent in August 1995.</p>
<p>Compared with July, the load factor was unchanged.</p>
<p>Swissair gave following details:</p>
<p>				 August 1996  vs  August 1995</p>
<p> Total load factor	 70.8 pct     vs  69.6 pct</p>
<p> Passenger load factor   72.4 pct     vs  70.5 pct</p>
<p> Passengers carried	802,884	vs  770,899</p>
<p>A Swissair statement also gave following details in thousands of tonnes kilometres (tkm):</p>
<p>				  August 1996  vs   August 1995</p>
<p> Available tkm		485,694	vs   447,675</p>
<p> Total revenue tkm	  343,792	vs   311,584</p>
<p> Passenger revenue tkm    213,002	vs   189,883</p>
<p> Mail/Cargo revenue tkm   130,790	vs   121,701</p>
<p>-- Zurich Editorial +41 1 631 7340</p>
